+ * "灯芯 · Lumen": the one bot body the app draws.
+ *
+ * Every bot is a pebble of frosted glass around a breathing light, with a visor and two light
+ * slits for eyes; identity is a colour, an emblem and — for the main bot — the five-peak crown.
+ * The design (2026-11-21) and its motion spec are fixed numbers; this module is the client's copy
+ * of them: the same geometry, the same seven states, the same timings.
+ *
+ * The frames are pure functions of time, so the renderer can jump to any moment and every avatar
+ * can animate on the UI thread without a re-render.
+ */
